# `next build` / `next start` load this. Deliberately empty of values: in
# production these come from the host's environment (Vercel → Project →
# Settings → Environment Variables), so a stale value here cannot silently
# ship to users.
#
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* is inlined at BUILD time, so changing any of these needs a
# redeploy, not a restart.

# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
